			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"胡桃"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 111130101,
					"content": "哦——！回来啦？比我想的还快！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "胡桃"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130102,
					"content": "派蒙，没有说漏嘴吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "胡桃"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130103,
					"content": "我看起来有这么不可靠吗！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130104,
					"content": "嘿嘿，开玩笑的，其实没关系，他们愿意拿出信物，就说明他们多少猜到了一些。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "胡桃"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130105,
					"content": "不过，幽灵和亡魂相关的事，无论发生什么，都是奇怪的，同时也是不奇怪的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "胡桃"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130106,
					"content": "他们不愿深究也是因为这一原因吧。要是真敢跟来，那…可就触碰到我的底线喽。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130107,
						111130108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "胡桃"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130107,
					"content": "听上去有点吓人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130109
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 111130109,
					"content": "「维护生死的边界」，这是往生堂最重要的工作内容嘛，我也会稍微比平时认真一点。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "胡桃"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130110,
					"content": "原来我们已经是特例了吗？跨越这种「边界」也没关系了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130111,
					"content": "那是当然，毕竟你们已经被卷进来了，和老孟一样，不在乎让你们多看点东西。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "胡桃"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130112,
					"content": "接下来要去的地方，无论看到什么，发生什么，都不要觉得惊讶。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "胡桃"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130113,
					"content": "那是存在于生死边界的平凡之地。要说特别之处，也就是不为人知而已。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "胡桃"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130114,
					"content": "千万千万不要大惊小怪哦？否则出来之前，我就得为你们清理记忆了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "胡桃"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130115,
					"content": "走吧！听话一点对大家都好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "胡桃"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130116,
					"content": "有、有点吓人…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130117,
					"content": "但就像她说的，我们已经被卷进来了，就走到最后吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130108,
					"content": "不知道你是认真的还是开玩笑。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130109
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1111302,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_AND",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"1111301",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 1111301,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"小五",
					"木木",
					"聪子"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 111122301,
					"content": "说起来，你们两个人都是亲手做的东西，只有我的是买来的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111122302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "木木"
				},
				{
					"id": 111122302,
					"content": "但你那一个，价值上来说，已经是我们的很多很多倍了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111122303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小五"
				},
				{
					"id": 111122303,
					"content": "重要的不是价钱，而是这些东西在我们童年时期的分量。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111122304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "聪子"
				},
				{
					"id": 111122304,
					"content": "还有，永远不能忘记的承诺啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "聪子"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1111304,
			"completionStepIds": [
				1111304
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_AUTO",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"1111304",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 1111304,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"回忆中的狼哥",
					"回忆中的小五",
					"回忆中的木木",
					"回忆中的聪子",
					"回忆中的老孟"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 111130401,
					"content": "又是海灯节，要是有一天能真的去看灯就好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "回忆中的小五"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130402,
					"content": "没有灯也可以许愿啊，我妈妈告诉我的，只要大声喊出来，梦想就会在未来实现。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "回忆中的聪子"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130403,
					"content": "大声喊出来，是不是…有点丢脸？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "回忆中的狼哥"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130404,
					"content": "你需要有人帮你起个头，大家都喊了，你就不会害羞了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "回忆中的老孟"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130405,
					"content": "对对对，那小五，你先来。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "回忆中的聪子"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130406,
					"content": "那…那我想，开一家大大的餐馆，有吃不完的饭菜还有点心！天天都能吃香嫩椒椒鸡！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "回忆中的小五"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130407,
					"content": "哈哈哈，瞧你这出息。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "回忆中的木木"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130408,
					"content": "你笑我，那你呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "回忆中的小五"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130409,
					"content": "那当然是赚钱！做大生意，赚很多很多钱！有钱了想干什么干什么，有钱了多开心啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "回忆中的木木"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130410,
					"content": "对啊，有了钱，那个超贵的玩具箱，不也是想买就能买？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "回忆中的老孟"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130411,
					"content": "不仅要买，还一人一个，不，一人好几个！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "回忆中的木木"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130412,
					"content": "那既然木木要当大商人，我就没必要赚钱了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "回忆中的聪子"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130413,
					"content": "不行不行，赚钱很辛苦的，别光指望我一个人啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "回忆中的木木"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130414,
					"content": "我以后，想学做明霄灯，就是好大好大的那个。霄灯我也要学，到时候当最好的工匠。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "回忆中的聪子"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130415,
					"content": "对哦，这样我们就不用去璃月港，也可以放霄灯过节了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "回忆中的狼哥"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130416,
					"content": "说了这么多，老孟，狼哥，你们两个呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130417
					],
					"speakerTitle": "回忆中的小五"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130417,
					"content": "我啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "回忆中的狼哥"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130418,
					"content": "啊，都消失了，最关键的东西没听到。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130419,
					"content": "真怀念啊，这是我们最后一次，五个人一起过的海灯节吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130420
					],
					"speakerTitle": "老孟"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130420,
					"content": "都已经过去这么久了，大家都长大了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130421
					],
					"speakerTitle": "狼哥"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130421,
					"content": "不知道当时喊出来的这些愿望，真的实现了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130422,
						111130423
					],
					"speakerTitle": "狼哥"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130422,
					"content": "实现了哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130424
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 111130424,
					"content": "我们去找了他们三个，把信物都要来了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130425
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130425,
					"content": "小五当了大厨，木木成了大商人，聪子也成了霄灯工匠！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130426
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130426,
					"content": "这样啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130427
					],
					"speakerTitle": "狼哥"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130427,
					"content": "唔…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130428
					],
					"speakerTitle": "狼哥"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130428,
					"content": "当初说的，我们一直都记在心上，当作是无论如何都要完成的约定。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130429
					],
					"speakerTitle": "老孟"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130429,
					"content": "总之，先把这盏灯放起来吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130430
					],
					"speakerTitle": "老孟"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130430,
					"content": "#喂，{NICKNAME}，别不解风情啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130431
					],
					"speakerTitle": "胡桃"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130431,
					"content": "他们叙旧的时候，我们站远一点随便聊聊吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "胡桃"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130423,
					"content": "它们都在这里。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130424
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1111305,
			"completionStepIds": [
				1111305
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"1111305",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 1111305,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"胡桃"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 111130501,
					"content": "说我们不解风情，明明你才是最看不懂气氛的人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130502,
						111130504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130502,
					"content": "不是要维护生死的「边界」吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130503
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 111130503,
					"content": "老孟是已经跨越「边界」的人，只能像这样把他送回去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "胡桃"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130506,
					"content": "我之前说过，往生堂一开始做的并不是葬仪，而是类似医生一样的工作。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "胡桃"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130507,
					"content": "魔神战争时期，尸横遍野，生灵涂炭，传染病四处蔓延，「死亡」疯狂侵吞我们生者的世界。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "胡桃"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130508,
					"content": "那时候，往生堂诞生了，以微不足道的人类的身份，花费了漫长的时间，将死亡赶了回去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "胡桃"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130509,
					"content": "感觉付出了很大的代价。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130510,
					"content": "又过了很长时间，璃月港繁荣兴旺，所有人都在追逐名誉与摩拉，最后，疯狂的人触动了死亡的「遗产」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "胡桃"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130511,
					"content": "魔神残渣肆虐人世，具体的就不提了，总之那是「生」于极致的自毁，也是「死」在尽头的反噬。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "胡桃"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130512,
					"content": "在那之后又是很久很久，很久很久，平衡恢复，界线划清，才有了今天你们见到的璃月港，你们见到的往生堂，还有，我。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130513,
						111130515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "胡桃"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130513,
					"content": "原来你也会讲这么严肃的故事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130514
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 111130514,
					"content": "哈哈哈，这是老堂主最喜欢絮叨的东西，我觉得我讲的比他们都好啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "胡桃"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130517,
					"content": "能理解多少，就看你们了，我更希望你们完全听不懂，往生堂就是做葬仪生意的，仅此而已。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130518,
						111130519
					],
					"speakerTitle": "胡桃"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130518,
					"content": "或许这样最好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130520
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 111130520,
					"content": "这个时代是幸运的，但生与死能像这样和平相处，绝非理所当然。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130521
					],
					"speakerTitle": "胡桃"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130521,
					"content": "呼，差不多也到时候了，我们走吧！带他们去「起始与安息之地」！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130522
					],
					"speakerTitle": "胡桃"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130522,
					"content": "那是什么地方？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130523
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130523,
					"content": "就是我们一开始见面的地方。我随便想的名字，不要每句话都追问！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "胡桃"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130519,
					"content": "嗯，该回去了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130520
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 111130515,
					"content": "能多讲一点吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130516
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 111130516,
					"content": "不能！你的好奇心还真是旺盛。别忘了我的话，不需要知道的事，不知道更好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "胡桃"
				},
				{
					"id": 111130504,
					"content": "往生堂和我想象中的差别太大了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130505
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 111130505,
					"content": "是吗？只要能达成目标，做什么和怎么做都是细节问题吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111130506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "胡桃"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1111306,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
